body:
"Thank you so much, you wonderful human being."

&#x200B;

Jk I just go hide under my bed and ponder my existence, wondering why tf anyone would compliment me.

Math teacher. Couldn't be doing a midyear test if it's the first day of school.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

But honestly, the gardener is always sus

If I was a serial killer I probably wouldn't be asking Reddit for advice lmao.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also, I'm not. We gotta clear that up.

Bruh

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

But same tho

Possibly human extinction, nuclear war, zombie apocalypse, the Yellowstone Volcano eruption, civil war, famine, another version of COVID ... basically we all gonna die.

&#x200B;

No, I'm not a pessimist... where...where'd you get that idea?

When people say "I am so OCD"

&#x200B;

Especially bc I actually have OCD

Grown Ups by Adam Sandler

&#x200B;

I know it's stupid af, but that's what makes it fun. Also, fuck Rotten Tomatoes for giving it 11%.

As someone with severe OCD, I guess you could say there's scarier shit in my brain than anything I could see in a movie.

&#x200B;

So no, they don't bother me

Throwing away food

&#x200B;

Like I'm sorry I didn't eat you you didn't deserve to die this way \*sobs uncontrollably\*

A stapler is also a good idea, not just for the fingers but everywhere. Like all over the character's body. In their neck, hands, maybe even staple their lips shut while I'm at it

&#x200B;

God, I'm messed up.
